          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फिर आइएगा (phir āiegā) is phir, \"again\", and āiegā, the polite future of आना, \"to come\". CDIAL lists phir under a reconstructed phirati, \"turns\", whose old form became an adverb (CDIAL 9078)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
